  "descripcion": "Travel across Europe as king of the road, a trucker who delivers important cargo across impressive distances! With dozens of cities to explore, your endurance, skill and speed will all be pushed to their limits.",
  "generos": [
    "Indie",
    "Simuladores"
  ],
  "lanzamientoTexto": "12 OCT 2012",
  "metacritic": {
    "puntaje": 79,
